#. Key:	5207E01F4F2D7F34DC1F2CAADC68DC74
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.BP_LB_Character_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_LB_Character [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.BP_LB_Character_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_LB_Character [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",5207E01F4F2D7F34DC1F2CAADC68DC74"
msgid "You have been subjected to a lobotomy."
msgstr "당신은 전두엽제거술을 받았습니다."

#. Key:	183727D34564A06F8EB149AE1663A309
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Bear(0).COD_Bear
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Bear(0).COD_Bear
msgctxt ",183727D34564A06F8EB149AE1663A309"
msgid "The soft fur was stuffed with nothing but blood-soaked wool."
msgstr "보들보들한 털 안쪽은 피로 젖은 솜으로 가득 차 있었습니다."

#. Key:	F84B3F80410E6878E4E62E82A9E186B1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Bear(1).COD_Bear
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Bear(1).COD_Bear
msgctxt ",F84B3F80410E6878E4E62E82A9E186B1"
msgid "It’s time for eternal sleep; your little friend awaits one last hug."
msgstr "영원히 잠들 시간이에요, 당신의 작은 친구가 마지막 포옹을 기다립니다."

#. Key:	C485D84F49D74C98774880BE028E26FE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Bear(2).COD_Bear
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Bear(2).COD_Bear
msgctxt ",C485D84F49D74C98774880BE028E26FE"
msgid "What spilled from the burst seams were not fond memories."
msgstr "터진 솔기 사이로 새어 나온 것은 다정한 추억이 아니었습니다."

#. Key:	A64274C5488C06799AFEF99837C01F6E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_ChainSaw(0).COD_ChainSaw
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_ChainSaw(0).COD_ChainSaw
msgctxt ",A64274C5488C06799AFEF99837C01F6E"
msgid "Perhaps it's best if we keep the noise down..."
msgstr "소리를 줄이는 게 아마도 최선일 것입니다..."

#. Key:	C6179BCF4C718971C22F699674D3E22F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_ChainSaw(1).COD_ChainSaw
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_ChainSaw(1).COD_ChainSaw
msgctxt ",C6179BCF4C718971C22F699674D3E22F"
msgid "You'd better be careful not to make any sound..."
msgstr "최대한 소리를 내지 않도록 주의하는 것이 좋을 것입니다..."

#. Key:	969A3DA54C23C4B5C19B40B6A4A8A30A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_ChainSaw(2).COD_ChainSaw
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_ChainSaw(2).COD_ChainSaw
msgctxt ",969A3DA54C23C4B5C19B40B6A4A8A30A"
msgid "Be careful! Chainsaws are very dangerous..."
msgstr "조심하세요! 전기톱은 매우 위험합니다..."

#. Key:	BD31797C4852491B59EA43BE58BC7B5B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Day(0).COD_Day
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Day(0).COD_Day
msgctxt ",BD31797C4852491B59EA43BE58BC7B5B"
msgid "You failed to care for the patients in time."
msgstr "정해진 시간 안에 환자를 돌보지 못했습니다."

#. Key:	0D3AC69040229D1A2265058422BCEBA1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Day(1).COD_Day
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Day(1).COD_Day
msgctxt ",0D3AC69040229D1A2265058422BCEBA1"
msgid "The patients could no longer wait."
msgstr "환자들은 더 이상 기다릴 수 없었습니다."

#. Key:	F7FDA5FC48AB5D66FF0B9B824BCEAA65
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Day(2).COD_Day
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Day(2).COD_Day
msgctxt ",F7FDA5FC48AB5D66FF0B9B824BCEAA65"
msgid "In the end, patient were abandoned."
msgstr "그들은 결국 버려졌습니다."

#. Key:	9EC96EAF48C48E70D6EEAABCC5EDE130
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Doctor(0).COD_Doctor
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Doctor(0).COD_Doctor
msgctxt ",9EC96EAF48C48E70D6EEAABCC5EDE130"
msgid "The prescription is written. Now, it's time to remove the \"unnecessary\" limbs."
msgstr "처방은 끝났습니다. 이제 불필요한 사지부터 절단할 시간입니다."

#. Key:	1B36124146230F4A6915BB977C9134CE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Doctor(1).COD_Doctor
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Doctor(1).COD_Doctor
msgctxt ",1B36124146230F4A6915BB977C9134CE"
msgid "Only the cold scalpel can silence the voices that haunted your mind."
msgstr "차가운 메스만이 당신의 머릿속을 괴롭히던 그 목소리를 잠재울 것입니다."

#. Key:	49C8B9D14FA6FC6799FCBDBA915F1990
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Doctor(2).COD_Doctor
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Doctor(2).COD_Doctor
msgctxt ",49C8B9D14FA6FC6799FCBDBA915F1990"
msgid "Death is not a failure; it is the most perfect discharge the Doctor has granted."
msgstr "죽음은 실패가 아닙니다. 의사 선생님이 허락한 가장 완벽한 퇴원일 뿐입니다."

#. Key:	D20461354A075043E06BDDBEA97F15F6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_KKE(0).COD_KKE
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_KKE(0).COD_KKE
msgctxt ",D20461354A075043E06BDDBEA97F15F6"
msgid "Hide well, for the seeker has already found the rhythm of your heart."
msgstr "꼭꼭 숨으세요, 술래가 당신의 심장 소리를 찾아냈으니까요."

#. Key:	9B6D3FDB403C144FB62D7898D30374F6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_KKE(1).COD_KKE
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_KKE(1).COD_KKE
msgctxt ",9B6D3FDB403C144FB62D7898D30374F6"
msgid "Now that you've grown cold, you will be the girl’s most precious doll."
msgstr "차갑게 식어버린 당신은 이제 소녀의 가장 소중한 인형이 될 것입니다."

#. Key:	DD614BB3411CD0D32424238D7CBA3D7F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_KKE(2).COD_KKE
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_KKE(2).COD_KKE
msgctxt ",DD614BB3411CD0D32424238D7CBA3D7F"
msgid "The girl’s lullaby only ends when your final breath fades away."
msgstr "소녀의 자장가는 당신의 마지막 숨소리가 멎어야만 끝이 납니다."

#. Key:	0D50F33744653888066B3E937CC9306E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Knocker(0).COD_Knocker
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Knocker(0).COD_Knocker
msgctxt ",0D50F33744653888066B3E937CC9306E"
msgid "Stay in the room too long, and who knows what will happen..."
msgstr "방에 너무 오래 머무르다 보면, 무슨 일이 생길지 누가 알겠습니까..."

#. Key:	E677EEB7458A49792F68548A9180B344
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Knocker(1).COD_Knocker
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Knocker(1).COD_Knocker
msgctxt ",E677EEB7458A49792F68548A9180B344"
msgid "There's no telling what might occur if you remain in the room for an extended period."
msgstr "장시간 방에 머무르면 무슨 일이 일어날지 알 수 없습니다..."

#. Key:	D87FAE5D4113406AB60C2AA998711F1A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Knocker(2).COD_Knocker
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Knocker(2).COD_Knocker
msgctxt ",D87FAE5D4113406AB60C2AA998711F1A"
msgid "The saying goes that you die if the grim reaper calls your name three times, right?"
msgstr "저승사자가 이름을 세 번 부르면 죽는다는 말이 있죠, 그렇죠?"

#. Key:	65C0E688490789CC092E9B9B756AB93E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Night(0).COD_Night
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Night(0).COD_Night
msgctxt ",65C0E688490789CC092E9B9B756AB93E"
msgid "You failed to care for the patients in time."
msgstr "정해진 시간 안에 환자를 돌보지 못했습니다."

#. Key:	16EFCF434F4278F69876A0B7469EDCD2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Night(1).COD_Night
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Night(1).COD_Night
msgctxt ",16EFCF434F4278F69876A0B7469EDCD2"
msgid "The patients could no longer wait."
msgstr "환자들은 더 이상 기다릴 수 없었습니다."

#. Key:	BC164FA046AAEFA71CEE558EA83382B9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Night(2).COD_Night
#: /Game/Character/BP_LB_Character.Default__BP_LB_Character_C.COD_Night(2).COD_Night
msgctxt ",BC164FA046AAEFA71CEE558EA83382B9"
msgid "In the end, patient were abandoned."
