#. Key:	84569C454907DF6381278AAB2EEFA0E7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_JWP.BP_Patient_JWP_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_JWP [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_JWP.BP_Patient_JWP_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_JWP [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",84569C454907DF6381278AAB2EEFA0E7"
msgid "The patient reports difficulty maintaining sleep and exhibits persistent insomnia.\r\nFatigue and diminished concentration due to sleep deprivation are observed, accompanied by heightened irritability.\r\nA disrupted sleep rhythm is evident, characterized by nocturnal wandering throughout the ward."
msgstr "환자는 수면 유지에 어려움을 호소하며, 지속적인 불면 상태를 보임.\r\n수면 부족으로 인한 피로 및 집중력 저하가 관찰되며, 예민한 반응이 동반됨.\r\n야간 시간대에 병동을 배회하는 등 수면 리듬의 불균형이 확인됨."

#. Key:	AF629DCF4F0638E8561F06A62279CBCE
