#. Key:	C57E1258400EBCAD306F44AC36AB06A7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M2.BP_Patient_M2_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M2 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M2.BP_Patient_M2_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M2 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",C57E1258400EBCAD306F44AC36AB06A7"
msgid "He says that when he’s in the patient room,\r\nhe feels as if someone is watching him.\r\nAt times, that presence knocks on the door,\r\nand whenever it does,\r\nhe claims to see a dark figure."
msgstr "그가 병실에 혼자 있을때,\n누군가 그를 지켜보고 있다고 한다.\n그 존재는 문을 두드리고\n그럴때마다,\n그는 어두운 형체를 본다고 한다."

#. Key:	0753C4384E5E26CA871DFD999FDCC26D
