#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M4.BP_Patient_M4_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M4 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M4.BP_Patient_M4_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M4 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",C3607D61419FECA450EFB49DB7696F2F"
msgid "Hallucinogenic"
msgstr "환각증"

#. Key:	E370C31944ADE39BFA4C4E98399F19AE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M4.BP_Patient_M4_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M4 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M4.BP_Patient_M4_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M4 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",E370C31944ADE39BFA4C4E98399F19AE"
msgid "Subject continues to swear by the presence of a child wandering the corridors after dark\r\nThough the patient offers a minute account of the child’s appearance, no such being is to be found.\r\nI find the patient’s delusion most profound, as he remains utterly impervious to any correction of his senses."
msgstr "환자는 야간에 병동을 배회하는 특정 아동의 존재를 지속적으로 주장함.\r\n해당 아동에 대해 신체적 특징과 행동 양상을 구체적으로 진술하나, 객관적 확인은 불가능한 상태임.\r\n현실적인 대응을 거부하며 자신의 인식을 강하게 확신하는 모습 보임."

#. Key:	2E0C6DB94A8ACAAAF498AE9DD1392997
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M5.BP_Patient_M5_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M5 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M5.BP_Patient_M5_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M5 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",2E0C6DB94A8ACAAAF498AE9DD1392997"
msgid "Dementia"
msgstr "치매"

#. Key:	3A77B34744AC8C7CF4B51B8A5ED1790E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M5.BP_Patient_M5_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M5 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M5.BP_Patient_M5_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M5 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",3A77B34744AC8C7CF4B51B8A5ED1790E"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	C40CA4E9455D8202C2005D8F519434F6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M5.BP_Patient_M5_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M5 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_M5.BP_Patient_M5_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_M5 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",C40CA4E9455D8202C2005D8F519434F6"
msgid "The patient exhibits an inability to recall recent events, suggesting the onset of degenerative dementia.\r\nAlong with memory impairment, a decline in temporal orientation is observed, leading to profound confusion regarding the present circumstances.\r\nRepetitive and purposeless behavior is noted, such as wandering the same area incessantly."
msgstr "환자는 최근의 사건을 기억하지 못하는 양상을 보이며, 퇴행성 치매가 의심됨.\r\n기억 장애와 함께 시간 지남력 저하가 관찰되며, 현재 상황에 대한 인식에 혼선을 보임.\r\n동일한 장소를 반복적으로 배회하는 등 반복적이고 목적성이 불분명한 행동이 확인됨."

#. Key:	1B1994D242DDA28144A8E58EBBCB2DEB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W1.BP_Patient_W1_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W1 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W1.BP_Patient_W1_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W1 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",1B1994D242DDA28144A8E58EBBCB2DEB"
msgid "Emma Garcia"
msgstr "엠마 그라시아"

#. Key:	2486223C4D3FF1BCA18720BB615969CE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W1.BP_Patient_W1_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W1 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W1.BP_Patient_W1_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W1 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",2486223C4D3FF1BCA18720BB615969CE"
msgid "Three months ago, she lost her entire family\r\nto a murderer. She is convinced the killer\r\nwill return for her, believing he has acute\r\nhearing and will find her if she makes even\r\nthe slightest sound."
msgstr "3개월 전, 그녀는 살인마에게 온 가족을\r\n잃어버렸다. 그녀는 살인마가 돌아와서\r\n자신을 죽일 것이라며 소리친다.\r\n살인마는 귀가 매우 밝아서 작은 소리라도 낸다면\r\n자신을 찾아낼 것이라고 한다."

#. Key:	273C2F214429F888BFB55B874F9577BD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W1.BP_Patient_W1_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W1 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W1.BP_Patient_W1_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W1 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",273C2F214429F888BFB55B874F9577BD"
msgid "Delusional Disorder"
msgstr "망상 장애"

#. Key:	230481684C29DD475E90BD98F81DF568
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W2.BP_Patient_W2_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W2 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W2.BP_Patient_W2_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W2 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",230481684C29DD475E90BD98F81DF568"
msgid "He says he can’t sleep because every night \r\nhe hears a music box and a chainsaw echoing\r\n in the hallway.He looks extremely unstable,\r\n completely consumed by fear."
msgstr "매일 밤마다 복도에서 들려오는 오르골 소리와 \r\n전기톱 소리가 울려서 잠을 잘 수 없다고 한다.\r\n그는 매우 불안해 보이고,\r\n공포에 사로잡혀 있다."

#. Key:	EA4F2DCC4F0B107FEE0E3FAC1AEF7FF5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W2.BP_Patient_W2_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W2 [Script Bytecode]
