#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W3.BP_Patient_W3_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W3 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W3.BP_Patient_W3_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W3 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",E00BD4304FFFCDC78B3D41B3A5A75638"
msgid "Marie Curie"
msgstr "마리 큐리"

#. Key:	E160FD3F483BC318866976BD1063C6D0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W3.BP_Patient_W3_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W3 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W3.BP_Patient_W3_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W3 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",E160FD3F483BC318866976BD1063C6D0"
msgid "She doesn’t respond. \r\nShe just laughs uncontrollably,\r\nas if she’s lost her mind.\r\nShe says she has a gift for everyone\r\nprepared for each room."
msgstr "그녀는 대답하지 않는다.\r\n가끔 미친것 처럼 웃기만 한다.\r\n그녀가 말하길 방마다 자신이 준비한.\r\n작은 선물들이 있다고 한다."

#. Key:	2315E46C48AE2881685E0C8A13F2FC40
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W4.BP_Patient_W4_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W4 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W4.BP_Patient_W4_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W4 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",2315E46C48AE2881685E0C8A13F2FC40"
msgid "The patient treats a doll as a living person, exhibiting infantile regression in their demeanor.\r\nDuring this process, the subject claims to have experienced disembodied voices and otherworldly occurrences.\r\nA pervasive conflation of puerile logic and reality is observed throughout the examination."
msgstr "환자는 인형을 실제 인물처럼 인식하며 아이같은 모습을 보임.\r\n이 과정에서 비현실적인 음성 및 상황을 경험했다고 진술함.\r\n전반적으로 유아적 사고와 현실 인식의 혼재가 관찰됨."

#. Key:	594001BD40FF8818479A7198E2DDF897
