#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W5.BP_Patient_W5_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W5 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W5.BP_Patient_W5_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W5 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",CE66FB16428AC2477EFF9BAD9CA2D202"
msgid "A delusional disorder"
msgstr "망상장애"

#. Key:	E71D537C4ECCE23CE021FF9438A864F7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W5.BP_Patient_W5_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W5 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W5.BP_Patient_W5_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W5 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",E71D537C4ECCE23CE021FF9438A864F7"
msgid "The patient persistently refers to non-existent spaces, maintaining an unshakable conviction in their reality.\r\nThe subject remains impervious to external reason or contradiction, exhibiting a profound disjunction from reality.\r\nThis delusional state is accompanied by manifestations of anxiety and hypervigilance related to the imagined locales."
msgstr "환자는 실제로 존재하지 않는 공간에 대한 이야기를 지속적으로 언급하며, 해당 내용을 사실로 확신하는 모습을 보임.\r\n외부의 설명이나 반박에도 인식을 수정하지 않으며, 현실과의 괴리가 관찰됨.\r\n망상 내용과 관련된 불안 및 경계 반응이 동반되는 양상을 보임."

#. Key:	B471D3744D6F1D3D6EE991A25C9D0C08
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W6.BP_Patient_W6_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W6 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W6.BP_Patient_W6_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W6 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",B471D3744D6F1D3D6EE991A25C9D0C08"
msgid "Grace"
msgstr "그레이스"

#. Key:	BFE13C234AB4C9ED31FDA1A284DF5479
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W6.BP_Patient_W6_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W6 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W6.BP_Patient_W6_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W6 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",BFE13C234AB4C9ED31FDA1A284DF5479"
msgid "The patient is in a state of acute terror, exhibiting repetitive vocalizations that render coherent communication impossible.\r\nThe subject continually professes threats to their own preservation, manifesting an inordinate degree of apprehension regarding their circumstances.\r\nWith a marked enfeeblement of emotional governance, the patient displays a reaction bordering upon clinical panic."
msgstr "환자는 극심한 공포 상태에서 반복적인 언어 표현을 보이며, 정상적인 의사소통이 어려운 상태임.\r\n자신의 생존과 관련된 위협을 지속적으로 호소하며, 상황에 대한 과도한 불안 반응이 관찰됨.\r\n감정 조절이 저하된 상태로, 공황에 가까운 반응 양상을 보임."

#. Key:	E30D4E274F9BF5FBA3FC3C99825B5EB9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W6.BP_Patient_W6_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W6 [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/NPC/BP_Patient_W6.BP_Patient_W6_C:ExecuteUbergraph_BP_Patient_W6 [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",E30D4E274F9BF5FBA3FC3C99825B5EB9"
msgid "Panic disorder"
msgstr "공황장애"

#. Key:	10386E55482A73BA5F7B1EB2844656CD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/SQ/Last_Run_SQ.Last_Run_SQ_DirectorBP_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Last_Run_SQ_DirectorBP [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/SQ/Last_Run_SQ.Last_Run_SQ_DirectorBP_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Last_Run_SQ_DirectorBP [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",10386E55482A73BA5F7B1EB2844656CD"
msgid "Ah... You clearly need to be fixed. Come here. I’ll help you."
msgstr "치료가 필요해 보이는구나. 내가 도와줄게. 얼른 오렴!"

#. Key:	3B6022D546A3C8540D7C8D81FE3A8E39
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/SQ/Last_Run_SQ.Last_Run_SQ_DirectorBP_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Last_Run_SQ_DirectorBP [Script Bytecode]
#: /Game/SQ/Last_Run_SQ.Last_Run_SQ_DirectorBP_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Last_Run_SQ_DirectorBP [Script Bytecode]
msgctxt ",3B6022D546A3C8540D7C8D81FE3A8E39"
msgid "Did I see that right?"
msgstr "내가 잘못 본건가?"

#. Key:	3BE7A70841218395FA1630BA04A89E35
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/SQ/Last_Run_SQ.Last_Run_SQ_DirectorBP_C:ExecuteUbergraph_Last_Run_SQ_DirectorBP [Script Bytecode]
