#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_4.DialogueText
msgctxt ",CCF74794425F41A9672B009E39781107"
msgid "...There's no need to look into it. And no one here is in their right mind."
msgstr "심심한지섭이"

#. Key:	1AE8592641ABB7141B8B45A59B5F0778
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_4.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_4.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",1AE8592641ABB7141B8B45A59B5F0778"
msgid "Nurse"
msgstr "간호사"

#. Key:	85123B6A4C3FBE5348B6CDB1187FBAA7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_5.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_5.DialogueText
msgctxt ",85123B6A4C3FBE5348B6CDB1187FBAA7"
msgid "Lately, things seem to change places every night. Even though no one’s supposed to be out after curfew."
msgstr "요즘 밤마다 물건 위치가 바뀌는 것 같아요. 밤엔 통행 금지 시간인데 말이죠"

#. Key:	926FBD57406C16163AF67482224F155A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_6.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_6.DialogueText
msgctxt ",926FBD57406C16163AF67482224F155A"
msgid "Just in case... don’t wander around at night. During the day, you’re free to do whatever you want. ...As long as it isn’t dangerous."
msgstr "혹시나 해서 말하는데, 밤엔 돌아다니지 마세요. 낮엔 뭘 하든 당신 자유예요. …위험하지 않은 선에서는."

#. Key:	DB94543B4A5D1A7530DC4896261B42D3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_n0.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_n0.DialogueText
msgctxt ",DB94543B4A5D1A7530DC4896261B42D3"
msgid "The weather is really nice, isn't it?"
msgstr "날씨가 참 좋죠?"

#. Key:	619D032A4AFF519E1CE27997248E771D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_n0.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.Nu_n0.SpeakerName
