msgctxt ",8C4B018C49D489DAE540C5A496963994"
msgid "...Right. You should probably get some rest."
msgstr "..그렇군요. 당신은 조금 쉬는게 좋겠네요."

#. Key:	252F064E40F41E7D04AA9888CDC4523E
