#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_02.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_02.DialogueText
msgctxt ",E8928AE6479AA5C3D380DCAF2C5C0C75"
msgid "What the hell is happening...?"
msgstr "무슨 일이시죠?"

#. Key:	7F273FE8417452D66AC68B9A7E4A056F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_02.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_02.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",7F273FE8417452D66AC68B9A7E4A056F"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	72EA4B8349B6BF51E87CC48AF045F477
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_03.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_03.DialogueText
msgctxt ",72EA4B8349B6BF51E87CC48AF045F477"
msgid "Have you... have you seen a child wandering around here at night?"
msgstr "혹시… 밤마다 돌아다니는 꼬마 하나 본 적 있어?"

#. Key:	B876E8DA40A77725EF20ACB820A77FCF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_03.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_03.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",B876E8DA40A77725EF20ACB820A77FCF"
msgid "Marcus Webb"
msgstr "마커스 웹"

#. Key:	ECDF796947699FEFA79A7AA54EADCE41
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_04.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_04.DialogueText
msgctxt ",ECDF796947699FEFA79A7AA54EADCE41"
msgid "A child? I’ve worked here quite some time, but... no, I haven’t seen anyone like that."
msgstr "어린아이요? 저는 여기 꽤 오래 근무했지만… 본 적 없습니다."

#. Key:	8212E81B4B12076685B5279936E8346D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_04.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_04.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",8212E81B4B12076685B5279936E8346D"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	92D7A4DF49D6D0F8473251828C8EC208
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_05.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_05.DialogueText
msgctxt ",92D7A4DF49D6D0F8473251828C8EC208"
msgid "Worked? Whatever, just be careful. That brat seems to have lost his mind, too."
msgstr "근무? 아무튼 조심해. 그 꼬맹이도 정신이 나간 것 같거든."

#. Key:	B861DD1E42B59BC71AC01F8F480C196A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_05.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_05.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",B861DD1E42B59BC71AC01F8F480C196A"
msgid "Marcus Webb"
msgstr "마커스 웹"

#. Key:	F154F10D44AC4CBCEEF17B864D684035
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_06.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_06.DialogueText
msgctxt ",F154F10D44AC4CBCEEF17B864D684035"
msgid "Then shouldn’t we contact his parents and send him home?"
msgstr "그럼 부모님께 연락해서 집으로 돌려보내야 하는 거 아닌가요?"

#. Key:	0B350D3149CBF2F95210278B02BD4B23
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_06.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_06.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",0B350D3149CBF2F95210278B02BD4B23"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	0F4E07714D8C83A79D4DBEB0E239D369
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_07.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_07.DialogueText
msgctxt ",0F4E07714D8C83A79D4DBEB0E239D369"
msgid "Parents? ...Ha, don't make me laugh. I don't have such things as parents."
msgstr "부모? …하, 웃기지 마.나는 부모 따윈 없어."

#. Key:	9334567E43E8A8DE9616BF93D846D4E6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_07.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_07.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",9334567E43E8A8DE9616BF93D846D4E6"
msgid "Marcus Webb"
msgstr "마커스 웹"

#. Key:	5E5A9AE7406EE365A8B37DB4B1D2BAFC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_08.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_08.DialogueText
msgctxt ",5E5A9AE7406EE365A8B37DB4B1D2BAFC"
msgid "(Thinking: As expected... he is not in his right mind. Still, I should find the child and send him back.)  \"Where did you see him last?"
msgstr "(역시… 제정신은 아닌 것 같다. 그래도 아이는 내가 찾아서 돌려보내야겠다.)  마지막으로 어디서 봤습니까?"

#. Key:	D99F0248484A97244D17A497CA6633FD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_08.SpeakerName
