msgctxt ",D99F0248484A97244D17A497CA6633FD"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	779F3811458C30EFA3A5CCA18174D06D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_09.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_09.DialogueText
msgctxt ",779F3811458C30EFA3A5CCA18174D06D"
msgid "This ward is too bright, maybe that's why... he isn't visible here. That lad, he seems to loathe the light."
msgstr "이 병동은 너무 밝아서 그런지… 여기선 안 보여.그 녀석, 밝은 걸 싫어하는 것 같더군."

#. Key:	ADE3FDF24EA16B64598AE18607607B26
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_09.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_09.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",ADE3FDF24EA16B64598AE18607607B26"
msgid "Marcus Webb"
msgstr "마커스 웹"

#. Key:	FFAF2BA64755883D325C0E9489AAFAB1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_10.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_10.DialogueText
msgctxt ",FFAF2BA64755883D325C0E9489AAFAB1"
msgid "I see. I’ll look for him myself. Could you describe his appearance?"
msgstr "알겠습니다. 제가 한번 찾아보겠습니다. 인상착의를 알려줄 수 있나요 ?"

#. Key:	B3A624BD45332AA527B2539F6B2BCB32
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_10.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_10.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",B3A624BD45332AA527B2539F6B2BCB32"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	E8E151634E4C9ED7542AF08FD69DE70F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_11.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_11.DialogueText
msgctxt ",E8E151634E4C9ED7542AF08FD69DE70F"
msgid "Look for him? Why bother! That thing... it's a monster. You'd best be on your guard."
msgstr "찾긴 뭘 찾아!!그 녀석도… 괴물이야. 조심하는 게 좋을 거다."

#. Key:	0BB5C6F24AA71C4590B9CCBE5BD80226
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_11.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_11.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",0BB5C6F24AA71C4590B9CCBE5BD80226"
msgid "Marcus Webb"
msgstr "마커스 웹"

#. Key:	7901127A4A9F8B029DDF5D8BD3A608D4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_12.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_12.DialogueText
msgctxt ",7901127A4A9F8B029DDF5D8BD3A608D4"
msgid "There are dozens of monsters living in this place. Perhaps... you might be one of them, too."
msgstr "이곳엔… 수십 명의 괴물이 살아.어쩌면… 너도 그중 하나일지 모르지."

#. Key:	37223C014DB9FC80BD48E6BA7DDAABE3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_12.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_12.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",37223C014DB9FC80BD48E6BA7DDAABE3"
msgid "Marcus Webb"
msgstr "마커스 웹"

#. Key:	B9C793834DB816D43CC8BBACBD61AD99
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_13.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_13.DialogueText
msgctxt ",B9C793834DB816D43CC8BBACBD61AD99"
msgid "The boy is about 150cm tall and is wearing a bag."
msgstr "그 꼬맹이 키가 150정도에 가방을 매고 있어."

#. Key:	F27290E44CDCD6769E9763818A91DCF1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_13.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_13.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",F27290E44CDCD6769E9763818A91DCF1"
msgid "Marcus Webb"
msgstr "마커스 웹"

#. Key:	8A8F312F439A8382B1FB51A0B8F82EB0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_14.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_14.DialogueText
msgctxt ",8A8F312F439A8382B1FB51A0B8F82EB0"
msgid "Thank you. But what do you mean by 'monster'?"
msgstr "고마워요. 근데 괴물이요 ? 그게 무슨 뜻이죠?"

#. Key:	6A239FA941076A66796C19AA60C4F28E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_14.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_14.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",6A239FA941076A66796C19AA60C4F28E"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	BFBBDEAB440A9FFE5A6535A1AD1DDDBE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_15.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_15.DialogueText
msgctxt ",BFBBDEAB440A9FFE5A6535A1AD1DDDBE"
msgid "…"
msgstr "…"

#. Key:	CD52D2024629236BB95766B03DAA2DB4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_15.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_15.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",CD52D2024629236BB95766B03DAA2DB4"
msgid "Marcus Webb"
msgstr "마커스 웹"

#. Key:	6028AB3143EE592D7031D9AF611AE9A8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_16.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_16.DialogueText
msgctxt ",6028AB3143EE592D7031D9AF611AE9A8"
msgid "(He says nothing more...)"
msgstr "(더 이상 아무 말도 하지 않는다…)"

#. Key:	7E905A94401C99B6871294968D481921
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_16.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M4_16.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",7E905A94401C99B6871294968D481921"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	AA7800024A9E94D5F4FC2FB85C78FFBE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_0.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_0.DialogueText
msgctxt ",AA7800024A9E94D5F4FC2FB85C78FFBE"
msgid "Tell me, have you perchance heard the rumor?"
msgstr "자네, 혹시 그 소문 들었나?"

#. Key:	5F69DA8D4847E6AF7C5E238033882039
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_0.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_0.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",5F69DA8D4847E6AF7C5E238033882039"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	1340236F49D5377A77E4B0B87EFEC579
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_1.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_1.DialogueText
msgctxt ",1340236F49D5377A77E4B0B87EFEC579"
msgid "Hmm... I have heard many unsettling tales of late. Even just moments ago."
msgstr "음... 요즘 충격적인 이야기를 많이 듣긴 했죠. 방금 전에도요."

#. Key:	02D866B14564E06F3DBF16B698989750
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_1.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_1.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",02D866B14564E06F3DBF16B698989750"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	8AFCACB54D52925B3C7C3CAE51CEAB93
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_10.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_10.DialogueText
msgctxt ",8AFCACB54D52925B3C7C3CAE51CEAB93"
msgid "The trouble is, that very mannequin is said to be here, within the walls of this asylum."
msgstr "문제는, 그 마네킹이 지금 이 병원에 있다는 거야."

#. Key:	9304226A41CFE7047C54078445A82348
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_10.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_10.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",9304226A41CFE7047C54078445A82348"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	1BDC79494A5E7925F9EED3BCB529FE06
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_11.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_11.DialogueText
msgctxt ",1BDC79494A5E7925F9EED3BCB529FE06"
msgid "In our Hospital?"
msgstr "우리 병원에요?"

#. Key:	0018AD394D2FB6752E2D2BB7769FAB99
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_11.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_11.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",0018AD394D2FB6752E2D2BB7769FAB99"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	A040B7214799595BD6813FBB9FBDED34
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_12.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_12.DialogueText
msgctxt ",A040B7214799595BD6813FBB9FBDED34"
msgid "Indeed. Some patients claim that once you have laid eyes upon it, it follows you wherever you go, performing its silent dance."
msgstr "그래. 몇몇 환자들 말로는, 그 마네킹을 한 번이라도 보고 나면 어디에 있든 따라와서 춤을 춰 보인다고 하더군."

#. Key:	632427FE4E9632CCEF40769E280F9D27
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_12.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_12.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",632427FE4E9632CCEF40769E280F9D27"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	946B76DD41EE56BF5FECA48F8814BEEA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_13.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_13.DialogueText
msgctxt ",946B76DD41EE56BF5FECA48F8814BEEA"
msgid "What a truly ghastly story..."
msgstr "정말 잔혹한 이야기네요..."

#. Key:	FB95E99E47906D429BC004980806F76A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_13.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_13.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",FB95E99E47906D429BC004980806F76A"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	38B7AE034587F1D0F47A1D9CA6E227AC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_14.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_14.DialogueText
msgctxt ",38B7AE034587F1D0F47A1D9CA6E227AC"
msgid "Ghastly, indeed. But pay it no mind. It is merely a ghost story, after all."
msgstr "잔혹하지. 뭐, 너무 귀담아듣지는 말게. 어쨌거나 괴담일 뿐이니까."

#. Key:	3DF9EBC74049BCC8A4379D830E57EDED
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_14.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_14.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",3DF9EBC74049BCC8A4379D830E57EDED"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	8E6EB116463750CAA3D25899AE9271AC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_15.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_15.DialogueText
msgctxt ",8E6EB116463750CAA3D25899AE9271AC"
msgid "Thank you for sharing it with me."
msgstr "말씀해 주셔서 감사해요."

#. Key:	EDF5AB54413FD9C36B1F1CBFF2B15F07
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_15.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_15.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",EDF5AB54413FD9C36B1F1CBFF2B15F07"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	97C65B5149A5E420FD0EDFB2EAF1C633
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_16.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_16.DialogueText
msgctxt ",97C65B5149A5E420FD0EDFB2EAF1C633"
msgid "Should you ever encounter that mannequin... do not turn away. Look upon it. That child, too, must long for someone to witness her."
msgstr "혹시라도 그 마네킹을 마주치게 된다면... 외면하지 말고 바라봐 주게. 그 아이도, 누군가 자신을 봐주길 바라고 있을 테니까."

#. Key:	5D0052344D05A6386A6767A3B9EE8B05
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_16.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_16.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",5D0052344D05A6386A6767A3B9EE8B05"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	5EF84F7C472C57BB930DDC9BBC9C64F0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_2.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_2.DialogueText
msgctxt ",5EF84F7C472C57BB930DDC9BBC9C64F0"
msgid "Now, have you heard the tale of how the Dancing Mannequin came to be?"
msgstr "그럼 혹시 춤추는 마네킹에 대해선 들어본 적 있나?"

#. Key:	716C425B48D1C38930B6CEB074207EEB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_2.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_2.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",716C425B48D1C38930B6CEB074207EEB"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	68F8A9B1495DE7F586304B8BC16F4DCE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_3.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_3.DialogueText
msgctxt ",68F8A9B1495DE7F586304B8BC16F4DCE"
msgid "A dancing mannequin? That is news to me."
msgstr "춤추는 마네킹이요? 처음 듣는데요."

#. Key:	AC5B343D49FEBF7873374B94098A72E7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_3.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_3.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",AC5B343D49FEBF7873374B94098A72E7"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	CCB3D0134F81CA8D6495598D0B40557B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_4.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_4.DialogueText
msgctxt ",CCB3D0134F81CA8D6495598D0B40557B"
msgid "It happened long ago. There was a firm that manufactured mannequins by melting down a plastic-like substance. It was quite popular, touted as being 'recyclable' and 'harmonious with nature.'"
msgstr "오래전 일이야. 플라스틱 같은 걸 녹여서 마네킹을 만드는 회사가 있었어. 재활용도 되고 친환경적이라고 꽤 인기가 많았지."

#. Key:	8057DBB04A8943CFCA01C4844A1E7BD9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_4.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_4.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",8057DBB04A8943CFCA01C4844A1E7BD9"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	208108EC41E298FD7A4C7AB15CC1AF7B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_5.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_5.DialogueText
msgctxt ",208108EC41E298FD7A4C7AB15CC1AF7B"
msgid "A widow worked at that factory; having no one to care for her child, she would often bring the little one with her."
msgstr "그 공장에 과부 한 명이 다니고 있었는데, 혼자 아이를 키우다 보니 공장에 데려오곤 했어."

#. Key:	21F08ADA463C3B8AF33754843FCC16D9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_5.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_5.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",21F08ADA463C3B8AF33754843FCC16D9"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	0581368C424792E053611B858036FF85
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_6.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_6.DialogueText
msgctxt ",0581368C424792E053611B858036FF85"
msgid "The workers were all fond of the child. She would dance for them, practicing her ballet and promising to become a grand prima ballerina one day."
msgstr "공장 사람들도 그 아이를 모두 좋아했어. 발레를 열심히 해서 훌륭한 무용수가 되겠다며 모두 앞에서 재롱을 부리곤 했거든."

#. Key:	2F525F0B4762644DAE5C4F98B2F2060B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_6.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_6.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",2F525F0B4762644DAE5C4F98B2F2060B"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	01F983904BF8694C7DAE36AA6FD02069
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_7.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_7.DialogueText
msgctxt ",01F983904BF8694C7DAE36AA6FD02069"
msgid "Then, tragedy struck. An exhausted laborer left a machine running by mistake. Unaware of the danger, the child used the iron platform as her stage and began to dance."
msgstr "그러다 사고가 났어. 한 직원이 과로로 지친 나머지 실수로 기계를 켜둔 채 퇴근했고, 아이는 그것도 모르고 철제 발판을 무대 삼아 발레를 췄지."

#. Key:	8DD5B60F4314EC33870D3BBC3AFBDACA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_7.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_7.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",8DD5B60F4314EC33870D3BBC3AFBDACA"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	09E705ED44E65574BDCD66A858A531E6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_8.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_8.DialogueText
msgctxt ",09E705ED44E65574BDCD66A858A531E6"
msgid "The platform gave way... and the child plummeted. She was dissolved, melted away alongside the molten mass."
msgstr "그러다 발판이 부서졌고... 아이는 그대로 떨어졌어. 플라스틱들과 함께 녹아버린 거야."

#. Key:	150FD3F94536CEFE53C797AA88D92D1C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_8.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_8.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",150FD3F94536CEFE53C797AA88D92D1C"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	D2627C454ED4D5159853CDA88F180F82
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_9.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_9.DialogueText
msgctxt ",D2627C454ED4D5159853CDA88F180F82"
msgid "By all rights, they should have halted the machines and discarded the vat. But the proprietor, plagued by a shortage of materials... used that very solution to finish a single mannequin."
msgstr "원래대로라면, 기계를 멈추고 그 용액을 전부 폐기해야 했어. 하지만 재료가 부족했던 사장은... 결국 그 용액으로 마네킹 하나를 완성했지."

#. Key:	674192F3445202FF5829E1AF39CB22A5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_9.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M5_9.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",674192F3445202FF5829E1AF39CB22A5"
msgid "Ethan Collins"
msgstr "에단 콜린스"

#. Key:	852AD370472F119257B6F4AD440279D5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_0.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_0.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,852AD370472F119257B6F4AD440279D5"
msgid "Excuse me. Do you have a moment to speak?"
msgstr "저기요. 잠깐 대화 가능한가요?"

#. Key:	DB0A222B420D5E202744C9A358F1483C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_0.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_0.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",DB0A222B420D5E202744C9A358F1483C"
msgid "Jeong woo Park"
msgstr "박정우"

#. Key:	F0AABB1240934016D52CD4B798C57337
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_1.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_1.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,F0AABB1240934016D52CD4B798C57337"
msgid "Certainly. I was just making my rounds to check on the condition of the patients."
msgstr "물론이죠. 마침 환자분들 상태를 확인하던 중이었어요."

#. Key:	ACE957F143E5876CF8CC7E8F97DC3CEF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_1.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_1.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",ACE957F143E5876CF8CC7E8F97DC3CEF"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	5FC247E84F7E0FF4D0E832A0E5724FF5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_10.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_10.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,5FC247E84F7E0FF4D0E832A0E5724FF5"
msgid "Surgical tools strewn about, beds and equipment so old and filthy they must have been there for a decade..."
msgstr "어질러진 수술 도구에 적어도 10년은 된 것 같은 낡고 더러운 침대와 기구들… 한마디로 엉망진창이었어요."

#. Key:	4268549149770B3AA2BD31A5A69BB2E4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_11.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_11.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,4268549149770B3AA2BD31A5A69BB2E4"
msgid "It was a complete shambles. But amidst it all, I found a room with a light on."
msgstr "그런데 그 안에서 불이 켜진 방을 하나 발견했어요."

#. Key:	322CE18D43D87504AD918D95178AC9E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_12.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_12.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,322CE18D43D87504AD918D95178AC9E1"
msgid "Inside, I..."
msgstr "저는… 그 안에서…"

#. Key:	AE87CA5E461E4C2A74C4FDA77CE94528
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_13.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_13.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,AE87CA5E461E4C2A74C4FDA77CE94528"
msgid "……"
msgstr "……"

#. Key:	DBE43EFF428CD08239FF90B5EA1169B7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_14.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_14.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,DBE43EFF428CD08239FF90B5EA1169B7"
msgid "No. Forget I said anything. You must never repeat what I just told you to anyone."
msgstr "아닙니다. 잊어 주세요. 방금 한 말은 절대 아무에게도 하시면 안 됩니다."

#. Key:	71BD925444DF8143B8717195A1B3FBB7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_15.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_15.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,71BD925444DF8143B8717195A1B3FBB7"
msgid "You have my word. However, you must not wander alone at such a late hour. It is a violation of the hospital regulations."
msgstr "약속할게요. 하지만 늦은 시간에 혼자 돌아다니시는 건 안 돼요. 병원 규칙에도 어긋나고요."

#. Key:	65D75A1A4EA7B0C3316A5B811B01BD97
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_15.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_15.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",65D75A1A4EA7B0C3316A5B811B01BD97"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	3320B2CB4C16F4368C6CEA85740AD8FA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_16.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_16.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,3320B2CB4C16F4368C6CEA85740AD8FA"
msgid "Understood. By any chance, which room do you stay in?"
msgstr "알겠습니다. 혹시 몇 호실이세요?"

#. Key:	C326B7E949DBCA4F98116989563CE292
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_17.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_17.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,C326B7E949DBCA4F98116989563CE292"
msgid "If you are asking after my quarters, I am staying in Room 201, Ward A."
msgstr "제 방을 묻는 것 이라면, 저는 A동 201호에서 지내고 있어요. "

#. Key:	38D116A34D14D86D89FB96BCF62998CC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_17.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_17.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",38D116A34D14D86D89FB96BCF62998CC"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	BA26183E4CB7F37063E87B886511EBC2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_18.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_18.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,BA26183E4CB7F37063E87B886511EBC2"
msgid "I see. It is a pleasure. My name is Jung-woo Park."
msgstr "그렇군요. 반가워요. 저는 박정우라고 해요."

#. Key:	E7536C9E4C2BB369D10F56B7AF4DC0F1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_19.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_19.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,E7536C9E4C2BB369D10F56B7AF4DC0F1"
msgid "Since our paths have crossed, may I ask your name?"
msgstr "이것도 인연인데, 이름을 여쭤봐도 될까요?"

#. Key:	5181399347618A95F780908163D648C5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_2.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_2.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,5181399347618A95F780908163D648C5"
msgid "You? Has something happened in the hospital?"
msgstr "당신이요 ? 혹시 병원에 무슨 일이 생겼나요 ?"

#. Key:	2B7533E247A9C1708C0F0E8E846DF8BA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_20.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_20.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,2B7533E247A9C1708C0F0E8E846DF8BA"
msgid "My name is..."
msgstr "제 이름은…"

#. Key:	EA7EEDEE4B11E7DB60B3C896B6B03FCC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_20.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_20.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",EA7EEDEE4B11E7DB60B3C896B6B03FCC"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	952CC1BC45717AE80F65BCA283D38847
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_21.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_21.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,952CC1BC45717AE80F65BCA283D38847"
msgid "......."
msgstr "......."

#. Key:	30FBF8F645396BDC52E6F4951A0C7101
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_22.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_22.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,30FBF8F645396BDC52E6F4951A0C7101"
msgid "(I cannot recall my name. I should find a mirror and check my nametag.)"
msgstr "( 이름이 기억나지 않는다. 거울이라도 가서 명찰을 확인해봐야겠다. )"

#. Key:	A8D354404AA39A69C12A3E8479F733AA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_23.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_23.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,A8D354404AA39A69C12A3E8479F733AA"
msgid "Do not feel forced to speak if you are unwilling. Here, take this."
msgstr "말하기 싫으면 말아요. 참, 이거 가져가요."

#. Key:	4C2130094C0308184C11F689B252B8E2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_23.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_23.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",4C2130094C0308184C11F689B252B8E2"
msgid "Jeong woo Park"
msgstr "박정우"

#. Key:	A22C6E4C45197451F0BEB19392BA8F86
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_24.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_24.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,A22C6E4C45197451F0BEB19392BA8F86"
msgid "(Obtained the basement key.)"
msgstr "( 지하실 열쇠를 얻었다. )"

#. Key:	4DC913CC4B5D1A9E264296AF5FED4F88
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_24.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_24.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",4DC913CC4B5D1A9E264296AF5FED4F88"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	86E85EC540D2AA152447B8A1BD712DAB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_25.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_25.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,86E85EC540D2AA152447B8A1BD712DAB"
msgid "(My bag is full. I should clear some space and speak to him again.  )"
msgstr "( 가방이 꽉 찼다. 비우고 다시 말을 걸어보자.  )"

#. Key:	8F000BB4466D39970FAA6FAA7CA26EA4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_3.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_3.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,8F000BB4466D39970FAA6FAA7CA26EA4"
msgid "No. It is simply my duty."
msgstr "아니요. 그냥 제 일이라서요."

#. Key:	B144A18F461E3437627172B86D3EEEDB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_3.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_3.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",B144A18F461E3437627172B86D3EEEDB"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	19CE9B434E05B0AE88454C8DEE551784
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_4.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_4.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,19CE9B434E05B0AE88454C8DEE551784"
msgid "I see. More importantly, have you ever met the Director?"
msgstr "…그렇군요. 그보다, 혹시 원장님을 만나 보신 적 있나요?"

#. Key:	31464D574B526CB404645891EE011ECF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_5.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_5.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,31464D574B526CB404645891EE011ECF"
msgid "No. Now that you mention it, I have seen the other nurses, but I do not believe I have ever met the Director."
msgstr "아니요. 그러고 보니, 다른 간호사 선생님들은 뵌 적 있어도 원장님은 한 번도 뵌 적이 없는 것 같네요."

#. Key:	8A537B3144CF0F81718707B8EA22AC18
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_5.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_5.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",8A537B3144CF0F81718707B8EA22AC18"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	36C595004284BF9542464098667A47E1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_6.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_6.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,36C595004284BF9542464098667A47E1"
msgid "Truth be told... I could not sleep on rainy nights, so I have been wandering the hospital here and there."
msgstr "사실은… 제가 비 오는 날 잠이 안 와서 병원 여기저기를 좀 돌아다녀 봤거든요."

#. Key:	14E8078D40ACB29260554B9D0E8E9223
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_7.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_7.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,14E8078D40ACB29260554B9D0E8E9223"
msgid "A patient must not roam the halls at night at their own discretion!"
msgstr "환자는 저녁 시간에 마음대로 돌아다니시면 안 돼요!"

#. Key:	081C1A2D44D0DF28E205F49ED6302E8F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_7.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_7.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",081C1A2D44D0DF28E205F49ED6302E8F"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	AC0608F84304072FF118DFA27A5A7764
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_8.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_8.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,AC0608F84304072FF118DFA27A5A7764"
msgid "I know. But what can I do when sleep refuses to come? Anyway, that is how I ended up descending into the basement of Ward C."
msgstr "알아요. 그래도 잠이 안 오는 걸 어쩌겠어요. 아무튼 그러다 C동 지하로 내려가게 됐어요."

#. Key:	F77C93BF4C3C8DF879708C9715C1AEE2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_9.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M6_9.DialogueText
msgctxt "DT_DialogueData1,F77C93BF4C3C8DF879708C9715C1AEE2"
msgid "The floor was damp as if there were a leak, and a sinister atmosphere seemed to hang in the air."
msgstr "지하는 물이 새는지 바닥이 축축하고, 기분 나쁜 분위기가 감돌더라고요."

#. Key:	430EB3A84521CCE341BE3AAA8CF0F167
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_01.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_01.DialogueText
msgctxt ",430EB3A84521CCE341BE3AAA8CF0F167"
msgid "How's it going lady?"
msgstr "어떻게 지내요 아가씨?"

#. Key:	6E9528CB470375B17F25CF8DE79416D4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_01.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_01.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",6E9528CB470375B17F25CF8DE79416D4"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	C03977D34C3CA035BADC538A5071C501
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_02.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_02.DialogueText
msgctxt ",C03977D34C3CA035BADC538A5071C501"
msgid "I'm a man ! Every night… in the hallway… I hear a music box and… a chainsaw."
msgstr "난 남자야! 매일 밤… 복도에서… 음악 상자 소리와… 전기톱 소리가 들려."

#. Key:	4AAF107C41D7C6747F79838A4D7E6D92
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_02.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_02.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",4AAF107C41D7C6747F79838A4D7E6D92"
msgid "Liam Davis"
msgstr "리암 데이비스"

#. Key:	D414C5C8483CBF70A4979597080097A0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_03.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_03.DialogueText
msgctxt ",D414C5C8483CBF70A4979597080097A0"
msgid "It’s so clear..."
msgstr "선명하게..."

#. Key:	FA9A96AB44DF0F580E6114A6D203BD79
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_04.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_04.DialogueText
msgctxt ",FA9A96AB44DF0F580E6114A6D203BD79"
msgid "It’s alright. You’re safe here. You don’t hear the sounds right now, do you?"
msgstr "괜찮아요. 당신은 안전해요. 지금은 아무 소리도 안들리죠 ?"

#. Key:	79CCD8BB449333CFFF55CF9C869D7B64
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_04.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_04.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",79CCD8BB449333CFFF55CF9C869D7B64"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	477DE8C545C313EEA5981B8EBC99E7DE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_05.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_05.DialogueText
msgctxt ",477DE8C545C313EEA5981B8EBC99E7DE"
msgid "Yes..No now..But Sometimes a shadow… something passes by"
msgstr "응..지금은 아니야..하지만 가끔 그림자가...뭔가 지나가는것 같기도 해"

#. Key:	099D70944208B1829A4CDA96A1637398
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_05.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_05.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",099D70944208B1829A4CDA96A1637398"
msgid "Liam Davis"
msgstr "리암 데이비스"

#. Key:	A70D76B741F7B6641E8120808A37AB51
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_06.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_06.DialogueText
msgctxt ",A70D76B741F7B6641E8120808A37AB51"
msgid "Every time the music box plays… it comes closer."
msgstr "매번 오르골이 울려...그리고 그것이 가까워져."

#. Key:	FF144619408640D19F5AA0AB20269F8C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_N01.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_M_N01.DialogueText
msgctxt ",FF144619408640D19F5AA0AB20269F8C"
msgid "He looks like sleeping well."
msgstr "잘 자고 있는듯 하다."

#. Key:	F55A1BB342755DE2163B4F8D0606058E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_MT_01.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_MT_01.DialogueText
msgctxt ",F55A1BB342755DE2163B4F8D0606058E"
msgid "He looks okay"
msgstr "괜찮아 보인다"

#. Key:	252C251D4E8D8C1BD8481AA3F7F11F42
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_MT_01.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_MT_01.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",252C251D4E8D8C1BD8481AA3F7F11F42"
msgid "???"
msgstr "???"

#. Key:	7B46143741014B2935088895EEAF34AB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_01.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_01.DialogueText
msgctxt ",7B46143741014B2935088895EEAF34AB"
msgid "Hi. How's it going?"
msgstr "안녕하세요. 어때요?"

#. Key:	881BABEB4B13A7D003EA6797F2800E96
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_01.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_01.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",881BABEB4B13A7D003EA6797F2800E96"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	02756A9541D01A058E3B69876352F60A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_02.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_02.DialogueText
msgctxt ",02756A9541D01A058E3B69876352F60A"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key:	D658E1D644A3B87680A609B7355F0DD3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_03.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_03.DialogueText
msgctxt ",D658E1D644A3B87680A609B7355F0DD3"
msgid "Do you understand what I’m saying?"
msgstr "제 말이 안들리세요?"

#. Key:	121BD3D845126BF4438DE194F9531A87
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_03.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_03.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",121BD3D845126BF4438DE194F9531A87"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	680175CD4FB7D914A0942FB65E702E5E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_04.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_04.DialogueText
msgctxt ",680175CD4FB7D914A0942FB65E702E5E"
msgid "...."
msgstr "...."

#. Key:	BC67DC1142EC68A8966AB9BA329433E7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_05.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_05.DialogueText
msgctxt ",BC67DC1142EC68A8966AB9BA329433E7"
msgid "Please, answer me. Are you hurt?"
msgstr "제발, 대답 좀 해줘요. 어디 아프세요?"

#. Key:	B269F9DC49ED4F4946AE32B4594F8AF2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_05.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_05.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",B269F9DC49ED4F4946AE32B4594F8AF2"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	FEF2965B4836C96DB784A686FDFEC25D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_06.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_06.DialogueText
msgctxt ",FEF2965B4836C96DB784A686FDFEC25D"
msgid "Ha Ha Ha Ha !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! Ha Ha !!"
msgstr "하하하하!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!! 하하 !!!!"

#. Key:	A9517A064785B31DBF005E87C46A1E40
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_07.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_07.DialogueText
msgctxt ",A9517A064785B31DBF005E87C46A1E40"
msgid "Stop it! What’s so funny?"
msgstr "멈춰요! 뭐가 그렇게 웃겨요?"

#. Key:	A77622514C8E7DDC9E7EEA9ADA42050B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_07.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_07.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",A77622514C8E7DDC9E7EEA9ADA42050B"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	87B744DB4E3C8C47CB6FF39A49E876A6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_08.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_08.DialogueText
msgctxt ",87B744DB4E3C8C47CB6FF39A49E876A6"
msgid "I’ve prepared a gift… in every room."
msgstr "내가 방마다 선물을 준비해뒀어.."

#. Key:	838A3E0B445785B148BA80968850F2BA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_08.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_08.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",838A3E0B445785B148BA80968850F2BA"
msgid "Marie Curie"
msgstr "마리 큐리"

#. Key:	8CC50D2A4318A686ADA1E7B7D4A09745
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_N01.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W2_N01.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",8CC50D2A4318A686ADA1E7B7D4A09745"
msgid "Marie Curie"
msgstr "마리 큐리"

#. Key:	206A0D2A401DC259B559068000EB9B19
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_0.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_0.DialogueText
msgctxt ",206A0D2A401DC259B559068000EB9B19"
msgid "Wait! Just a moment!"
msgstr "저기요 ! 잠깐만요 !"

#. Key:	877D345842880052CD0AACBAD73F3B90
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_0.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_0.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",877D345842880052CD0AACBAD73F3B90"
msgid "Sarah Mitchell"
msgstr "사라 미첼"

#. Key:	9646910F4AB93C8FB018B0B6387B9590
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_1.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_1.DialogueText
msgctxt ",9646910F4AB93C8FB018B0B6387B9590"
msgid "Do you require something?"
msgstr "필요하신 게 있으세요?"

#. Key:	5C3D678D4797FAE978B692BF7F0EFC31
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_1.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_1.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",5C3D678D4797FAE978B692BF7F0EFC31"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	D2637C1C48E4AD3ADF2364AF7851B171
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_10.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_10.DialogueText
msgctxt ",D2637C1C48E4AD3ADF2364AF7851B171"
msgid "She claimed to be the child's mother. She even threatened to kill me if I ever tried to take the child away again."
msgstr "자기가 이 아이의 부모라고 했어요. 또다시 데려가면 저를 죽이겠다고도 했고요."

#. Key:	A9FD7FCC4DEEA58DC181919D40FCC557
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_11.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_11.DialogueText
msgctxt ",A9FD7FCC4DEEA58DC181919D40FCC557"
msgid "So, did you simply leave it behind?"
msgstr "그래서 그냥 두고 오셨나요?"

#. Key:	9DDFE382402E8122A6A3CA8D5522DA75
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_11.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_11.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",9DDFE382402E8122A6A3CA8D5522DA75"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	D4BD8E6F438047D5B50994BCFEAF226B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_12.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_12.DialogueText
msgctxt ",D4BD8E6F438047D5B50994BCFEAF226B"
msgid "No. I ignored her and took the doll back to my room... but the lights flickered, and suddenly, the doll vanished."
msgstr "아뇨. 무시하고 인형을 챙겨서 방으로 돌아가려는데... 불이 깜빡이더니 갑자기 인형이 사라졌어요."

#. Key:	CB6E44F344154C684103E19281D2D304
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_13.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_13.DialogueText
msgctxt ",CB6E44F344154C684103E19281D2D304"
msgid "And you haven't been able to find it since?"
msgstr "그 뒤로는 못 찾으셨고요?"

#. Key:	CADEBF5D4E240075E13507B4DDC2D838
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_13.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_13.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",CADEBF5D4E240075E13507B4DDC2D838"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	7EA318E041ECF46285D993BB152029FF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_14.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_14.DialogueText
msgctxt ",7EA318E041ECF46285D993BB152029FF"
msgid "Yes. And the moment the doll disappeared, I heard a sharp, piercing screech."
msgstr "네. 그리고 인형이 사라지던 그 순간, 날카로운 쇳소리가 들렸어요."

#. Key:	900F4F4A406D2927D08239B501CBF837
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_15.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_15.DialogueText
msgctxt ",900F4F4A406D2927D08239B501CBF837"
msgid "...I shall look for it myself. Please wait a moment."
msgstr "...제가 찾아볼게요. 조금만 기다려 주세요."

#. Key:	7ED2CD314C4DDA6A1FB7ED9D70519C13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_15.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_15.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",7ED2CD314C4DDA6A1FB7ED9D70519C13"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	FF60FEF846831904A5219AA3B707D4D9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_2.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_2.DialogueText
msgctxt ",FF60FEF846831904A5219AA3B707D4D9"
msgid "Please find my cherished doll! It is a small, cute brown teddy bear."
msgstr "제 애착 인형을 찾아주세요! 귀엽고 작은 갈색 곰인형이에요."

#. Key:	03EF2C3044E956901669B4AE55564F1F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_3.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_3.DialogueText
msgctxt ",03EF2C3044E956901669B4AE55564F1F"
msgid "A doll? You mean you lost it?"
msgstr "인형이요? 잃어버리신 건가요?"

#. Key:	480F93DA44EDB66519E537A9F550D45D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_3.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_3.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",480F93DA44EDB66519E537A9F550D45D"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	524CDE6F4E59296DA74EF698A2782A8A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_4.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_4.DialogueText
msgctxt ",524CDE6F4E59296DA74EF698A2782A8A"
msgid "It was stolen, plain and simple... by that child’s mother."
msgstr "엄연히 도둑맞은 거죠... 그 아이의 엄마한테."

#. Key:	37A9B7E741168DAA32D3339CBFD44E53
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_5.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_5.DialogueText
msgctxt ",37A9B7E741168DAA32D3339CBFD44E53"
msgid "The mother... of a teddy bear?"
msgstr "곰인형의... 엄마요?"

#. Key:	3DD87C1C4C0626619BF56F824000DF9A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_5.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_5.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",3DD87C1C4C0626619BF56F824000DF9A"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	9344B3674531BB8402F1F69436143925
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_6.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_6.DialogueText
msgctxt ",9344B3674531BB8402F1F69436143925"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "네."

#. Key:	D9F8D6F44394EC3ADB43DDBA253BD18F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_7.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_7.DialogueText
msgctxt ",D9F8D6F44394EC3ADB43DDBA253BD18F"
msgid "A teddy bear with a mother. How peculiar."
msgstr "곰인형한테 엄마가 있다니, 신기하네요."

#. Key:	12EB24274A8536EC382092A3E9D0CC2F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_7.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_7.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",12EB24274A8536EC382092A3E9D0CC2F"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	3E1E569C489C8B509B5DF095EF28173B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_8.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_8.DialogueText
msgctxt ",3E1E569C489C8B509B5DF095EF28173B"
msgid "It is no jest! One day, the child vanished, and while searching for it, I found it in the adjacent ward.  I reached out to take it back with joy, but a voice called out from the darkness."
msgstr "농담이 아니에요! 어느 날 그 아이가 사라져서 찾아다녔는데, 옆 동에서 발견했어요.  기쁜 마음에 데리고 가려고 손을 뻗는데, 어둠 속에서 목소리가 들렸어요."

#. Key:	C81261074443DDE170B8C88DB8465278
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_9.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_9.DialogueText
msgctxt ",C81261074443DDE170B8C88DB8465278"
msgid "A voice?"
msgstr "목소리요?"

#. Key:	AB9AEACF4ED997B99413A7B725289161
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_9.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W4_9.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",AB9AEACF4ED997B99413A7B725289161"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	958755764A3AD603EAE67289CA18C833
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_0.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_0.DialogueText
msgctxt ",958755764A3AD603EAE67289CA18C833"
msgid "Hello. How are you feeling?"
msgstr "안녕하세요. 몸 상태는 어때요?"

#. Key:	118579334B6D071E7818DB92BD8B5938
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_0.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_0.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",118579334B6D071E7818DB92BD8B5938"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	12511E88463DB924260543A32A7B1D88
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_1.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_1.DialogueText
msgctxt ",12511E88463DB924260543A32A7B1D88"
msgid "I feel as though I am dying."
msgstr "죽을 것 같아."

#. Key:	D6DEFA814AC96EE2D76D7B8BEDD45853
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_1.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_1.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",D6DEFA814AC96EE2D76D7B8BEDD45853"
msgid "Olivia"
msgstr "올리비아"

#. Key:	012C6FB64672B6F0CE2FF0B789D5BE11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_10.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_10.DialogueText
msgctxt ",012C6FB64672B6F0CE2FF0B789D5BE11"
msgid "Whatever do you mean by that?"
msgstr "그게 무슨 말씀이세요?"

#. Key:	E08B55984751721C7ACDEBBAA289791C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_10.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_10.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",E08B55984751721C7ACDEBBAA289791C"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	25A93A964A9309B55A51E6A6B17A9810
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_11.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_11.DialogueText
msgctxt ",25A93A964A9309B55A51E6A6B17A9810"
msgid "The ceiling is lowering, bit by bit. I saw it with my own eyes. It is descending, ever so slightly."
msgstr "천장이 조금씩 내려오고 있다고. 내가 직접 확인했어. 분명히 미세하게 내려오고 있어."

#. Key:	3022C59943C52AED12C8E9A2DFD2D88E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_11.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_11.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",3022C59943C52AED12C8E9A2DFD2D88E"
msgid "Olivia"
msgstr "올리비아"

#. Key:	ED743E8C4BD5E432ED00328FB9D99FC6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_12.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_12.DialogueText
msgctxt ",ED743E8C4BD5E432ED00328FB9D99FC6"
msgid "That is impossible. I have worked here for several days and have never seen such a thing."
msgstr "그런 일은 없었어요. 며칠째 근무하면서 한 번도 그런 적 없었거든요."

#. Key:	A8E6DD564D075814686C329A007CC65C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_12.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_12.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",A8E6DD564D075814686C329A007CC65C"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	88CC640E420E9E0C63CFA6A87E61C956
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_13.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_13.DialogueText
msgctxt ",88CC640E420E9E0C63CFA6A87E61C956"
msgid "Worked here? You’re suffering for nothing, then. Go to the 3rd floor of Ward B. A few days ago, I drew a line on the wall where it met the ceiling. By now, that line will have vanished."
msgstr "근무라니, 사서 고생을 하네. B동 3층 가봐. 며칠 전에 천장이랑 맞닿은 벽에 선을 그어뒀거든. 지금쯤이면 그 선이 없어졌을 거야."

#. Key:	F56C4C75454FE13F1C4C8D86986FDB7A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_14.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_14.DialogueText
msgctxt ",F56C4C75454FE13F1C4C8D86986FDB7A"
msgid "What are you talking about? Our hospital only goes up to the 2nd floor."
msgstr "무슨 말씀이시죠? 우리 병원은 2층까지밖에 없는데요."

#. Key:	0711765448440780B67EEFA93DE13243
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_14.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_14.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",0711765448440780B67EEFA93DE13243"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	36949E264E44F61F69D726A371BC6EA1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_15.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_15.DialogueText
msgctxt ",36949E264E44F61F69D726A371BC6EA1"
msgid "You probably think I’m mad, too. But the third floor most certainly exists."
msgstr "너도 날 미친 사람 취급하겠지. 그래도 3층은 분명히 있어."

#. Key:	AC07586547358851C414F3BEDD29D8EE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_16.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_16.DialogueText
msgctxt ",AC07586547358851C414F3BEDD29D8EE"
msgid "(Thinking: He is definitely not in his right mind. Still, just to be sure, I should check Ward B.)"
msgstr "( 역시 정상은 아닌 것 같다. 그래도 혹시 모르니 B동을 한번 확인해봐야겠다. )"

#. Key:	DAF21E0743F4D24B8272E6A2064FEC2F
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_2.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_2.DialogueText
msgctxt ",DAF21E0743F4D24B8272E6A2064FEC2F"
msgid "Everything is alight?"
msgstr "어디가 안 좋으신가요?"

#. Key:	F9FAC79C49CC0A20BEE9DA9389E7BFEF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_2.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_2.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",F9FAC79C49CC0A20BEE9DA9389E7BFEF"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	86E4166B4EC9C2E0B7C2E9BE7EC7CDD6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_3.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_3.DialogueText
msgctxt ",86E4166B4EC9C2E0B7C2E9BE7EC7CDD6"
msgid "No. I'm not. Just let me out of here."
msgstr "전부 다. 그냥 나 좀 내보내줘."

#. Key:	DED3F9D84FC1A8AE0ABF018F5C1E5664
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_4.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_4.DialogueText
msgctxt ",DED3F9D84FC1A8AE0ABF018F5C1E5664"
msgid "I’m afraid that’s not possible. I’ll record your status on the chart for now."
msgstr "그건 어렵네요. 일단 차트에 기록해 둘게요."

#. Key:	C2D7B6184487EEA5240F4DB1255C51AA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_4.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_4.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",C2D7B6184487EEA5240F4DB1255C51AA"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	EE2A70EC4DBDD76B08916A90BAAAFD7C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_5.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_5.DialogueText
msgctxt ",EE2A70EC4DBDD76B08916A90BAAAFD7C"
msgid "Why on earth do you keep writing in those things?"
msgstr "도대체 그런 건 왜 쓰는 거야?"

#. Key:	7B28EDAB495D966ACC4597B1CE921838
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_6.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_6.DialogueText
msgctxt ",7B28EDAB495D966ACC4597B1CE921838"
msgid "It’s a sort of observation log. We record the condition of each patient."
msgstr "일종의 관찰 일지 같은 거예요. 환자분 상태를 기록해두는 거죠."

#. Key:	AACCB56B430B20E654CB88B8202B6124
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_6.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_6.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",AACCB56B430B20E654CB88B8202B6124"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	DB74F0994311488BE06C2692638BE6B5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_7.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_7.DialogueText
msgctxt ",DB74F0994311488BE06C2692638BE6B5"
msgid "You’re definitely not sane either. More importantly, let me out."
msgstr "확실히 너도 정상은 아니군. 그보다 나 좀 내보내줘."

#. Key:	5AA434174A3BD21D353779AE78344D1C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_8.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_8.DialogueText
msgctxt ",5AA434174A3BD21D353779AE78344D1C"
msgid "I’m sorry. As I told you, that is quite impossible."
msgstr "죄송해요. 말씀드렸다시피 그건 어렵습니다."

#. Key:	6BC1E90840C7C12615CB488D8297B00E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_8.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_8.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",6BC1E90840C7C12615CB488D8297B00E"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	4FA267644B69B063A5B87180B0E9AA7D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_9.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W5_9.DialogueText
msgctxt ",4FA267644B69B063A5B87180B0E9AA7D"
msgid "Everyone has to run. We’re all going to be crushed to death at this rate."
msgstr "다들 도망쳐야 해. 이러다 우리 모두 깔려 죽어."

#. Key:	91CE09F54C69243D87F0A7A7DD08512D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W6_0.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W6_0.DialogueText
msgctxt ",91CE09F54C69243D87F0A7A7DD08512D"
msgid "No, I don't want to, I said I don't want to, no."
msgstr "싫어. 난 싫다고. 싫단 말이야. 싫어."

#. Key:	C4710F694574CB5D559FDDA1C9BBEF2A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W6_0.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W6_0.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",C4710F694574CB5D559FDDA1C9BBEF2A"
msgid "Grace"
msgstr "그레이스"

#. Key:	C975E9A0489D481FEF70F8947D1B24EC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W6_1.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W6_1.DialogueText
msgctxt ",C975E9A0489D481FEF70F8947D1B24EC"
msgid "Patient! Please, calm down."
msgstr "환자분 ! 진정하세요."

#. Key:	E3FB9D924482F08EF04DFB8EED9994AE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W6_1.SpeakerName
