#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_02.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_02.DialogueText
msgctxt ",60BA9BA7405127558A0E5F9F94F403C5"
msgid "He’ll come back for me....I know he will."
msgstr "난 알아. 그는 분명 돌아올거야...!"

#. Key:	A0B159934886A8426CBE51B425B6F282
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_02.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_02.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",A0B159934886A8426CBE51B425B6F282"
msgid "Emma Gracia"
msgstr "엠마 그라시아"

#. Key:	8B4B608640BE1FA0FF5FA7A1DACF8E4B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_03.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_03.DialogueText
msgctxt ",8B4B608640BE1FA0FF5FA7A1DACF8E4B"
msgid "Can you tell me what happened?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 있었는지 말해 줄 수 있어요?"

#. Key:	32D849DA46FDE0886A5FAFA32C1B083D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_03.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_03.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",32D849DA46FDE0886A5FAFA32C1B083D"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	C3C6393E44DB5F8A66DEA186920E0DFB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_04.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_04.DialogueText
msgctxt ",C3C6393E44DB5F8A66DEA186920E0DFB"
msgid "Three months ago… a murderer killed my entire family."
msgstr "세 달 전에... 살인범이 내 가족들을 죽였어."

#. Key:	6ECF2F7D487D3541ED67F4B5DC4544AA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_05.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_05.DialogueText
msgctxt ",6ECF2F7D487D3541ED67F4B5DC4544AA"
msgid "I’m the only witness."
msgstr "내가 유일한 목격자야."

#. Key:	C14622F3425B8379CA0E2AAD98F546B3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_06.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_06.DialogueText
msgctxt ",C14622F3425B8379CA0E2AAD98F546B3"
msgid "So..He will come back for killing me."
msgstr "그래서..그는 분명 날 죽이러 올거야."

#. Key:	87560DCC4E82C1F374B7AAA126148AB7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_07.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_07.DialogueText
msgctxt ",87560DCC4E82C1F374B7AAA126148AB7"
msgid "It's ok ! Your in the safety hospital !"
msgstr "괜찮아요 ! 당신은 안전한 병원에 있어요!"

#. Key:	BE1E44CE4E9F82DD16E5D795287C6437
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_07.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_07.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",BE1E44CE4E9F82DD16E5D795287C6437"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	7891B65F4DAFFACF2653439B13D92814
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_08.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.P_W_08.DialogueText
msgctxt ",7891B65F4DAFFACF2653439B13D92814"
msgid "He has incredibly sharp hearing. If I make even the smallest sound… he’ll find me."
msgstr "그는 귀가 예민해. 내가 작은 소리라도 낸다면... 날 찾아낼 거야."

#. Key:	A95D334C4BAA3D38951FCCAA7C664F3A
