#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_02.DialogueText
msgctxt ",DDDFE54E400A9C7CF8C632AE386AC78F"
msgid "…When I’m in the room, I sometimes get this feeling… like someone is watching me."
msgstr "...방에 혼자 있을때, 누군가 날 지켜보는 느낌이 들어.."

#. Key:	56CA734F460C76254D6BB5AC938704D0
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_02.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_02.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",56CA734F460C76254D6BB5AC938704D0"
msgid "James Miller"
msgstr "제임스 밀러"

#. Key:	9895FC134E4E0DD31C679C94E8005EE5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_03.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_03.DialogueText
msgctxt ",9895FC134E4E0DD31C679C94E8005EE5"
msgid "Watching you? By who?"
msgstr "쳐다본다고요? 누가요?"

#. Key:	1C9A00384B801F59FE5DA7A95877B20B
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_03.SpeakerName
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_03.SpeakerName
msgctxt ",1C9A00384B801F59FE5DA7A95877B20B"
msgid "Me"
msgstr "나"

#. Key:	3266C2DD47135EB752D3818576D96195
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_04.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_04.DialogueText
msgctxt ",3266C2DD47135EB752D3818576D96195"
msgid "I don’t know. But every now and then, something knocks on the door."
msgstr "몰라. 하지만 가끔씩 뭔가가 문을 두드리곤 해."

#. Key:	E82968FC46EA03C8588C2794B948F676
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_05.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_05.DialogueText
msgctxt ",E82968FC46EA03C8588C2794B948F676"
msgid "Knocking? Did you actually see anything?"
msgstr "문을 두드린다고요? 뭔가 보였나요?"

#. Key:	AA89625A4A6CEBA43FE0F9931DBDE142
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_06.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_06.DialogueText
msgctxt ",AA89625A4A6CEBA43FE0F9931DBDE142"
msgid "Yeah… a few times. I caught a glimpse of a dark figure standing there."
msgstr "음..가끔 검은 형체가 서있는걸 봤어."

#. Key:	10DA8D9B44ADF3B21259788DDC2C4B28
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_07.DialogueText
#: /Game/UI/Data/DT_DialogueData.DT_DialogueData.PM2_07.DialogueText
msgctxt ",10DA8D9B44ADF3B21259788DDC2C4B28"
msgid "Sometimes, when I saw that dark figure, I could hear it laughing."
msgstr "그리고 내가 그것과 눈이 마주쳤을때, 웃는 소리가 들렸어."

