#. Key:	808437F5498115BDE22C92A07DFCF6EC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/WBP_Postit1.WBP_Postit1_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
#: /Game/UI/WBP_Postit1.WBP_Postit1_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
msgctxt ",808437F5498115BDE22C92A07DFCF6EC"
msgid "Don’t stay in the room too long!"
msgstr "방에 오래 머물러서는 안돼!"

#. Key:	68342961474C2C9DD383F0A558F4FCA5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/WBP_Postit2.WBP_Postit2_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
#: /Game/UI/WBP_Postit2.WBP_Postit2_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
msgctxt ",68342961474C2C9DD383F0A558F4FCA5"
msgid "If you hear a music box playing \r\nin the hallway, you must \r\nturn it off right away.\r\nIf you don’t… he will come."
msgstr "복도에서 오르골 소리가 \r\n들린다면, 당장 꺼버려. \r\n그러지 않으면...\r\n그가 올거야."

#. Key:	2D043A2A4395CF6E71A48EA23F3EE41D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/WBP_Postit3.WBP_Postit3_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
#: /Game/UI/WBP_Postit3.WBP_Postit3_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
msgctxt ",2D043A2A4395CF6E71A48EA23F3EE41D"
msgid "Make sure to keep the doors closed.\r\nHe might come in."
msgstr "문을 잘 닫고 다녀야해.\r\n그가 들어올지도 모르거든.."

#. Key:	C95B189C49E61494A5BABFACD065EFAF
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/WBP_Postit4.WBP_Postit4_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
#: /Game/UI/WBP_Postit4.WBP_Postit4_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
msgctxt ",C95B189C49E61494A5BABFACD065EFAF"
msgid "You need to check\r\nevery room carefully. \r\nThere might be useful things.\r\nlike a safe with a key inside."
msgstr "모든 방을 유심히 봐야해.\r\n유용한 것들이 있을거거든.\r\n예를 들어 열쇠가 담긴 금고 라던가."

#. Key:	433E4E1F4999F46D4307FD84FC26AB36
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/WBP_Postit5.WBP_Postit5_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
#: /Game/UI/WBP_Postit5.WBP_Postit5_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
msgctxt ",433E4E1F4999F46D4307FD84FC26AB36"
msgid "The vent in the first-floor bathroom\r\nis connected to Building B.\r\nYou’ll need to find a ladder."
msgstr "1층 화장실의 환풍구는\r\nB동 건물과 연결되어있어.\r\n사다리를 찾아야해."

#. Key:	733669A1414E42BDE21ED68E0733C911
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/WBP_Postit6.WBP_Postit6_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
#: /Game/UI/WBP_Postit6.WBP_Postit6_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
msgctxt ",733669A1414E42BDE21ED68E0733C911"
msgid "The boxes that crazy woman\r\nprepared are supposed to have \r\nbatteries in them… \r\nthough they might not."
msgstr "그 미친여자가 준비한 \r\n상자에는 배터리가 들어있어.\r\n아닐지도 모르고."

#. Key:	07A3FC184B2DA1FE70100D93F1F0181E
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/WBP_Postit8.WBP_Postit8_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
#: /Game/UI/WBP_Postit8.WBP_Postit8_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_0.Text
msgctxt ",07A3FC184B2DA1FE70100D93F1F0181E"
msgid "To maintain control over the patients,  \r\nthe key has been concealed within Room 209. \r\nThe passcode is the name of the Hospital Director."
msgstr "환자들을 통제하기 위해 \r\n209호에 키를 숨겨두었음. \r\n비밀번호는 병원장의 이름"

#. Key:	21D2099D4E5688F2AC906B922FCD77DA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/UI/WBP_VideoSubtitleWidget.WBP_VideoSubtitleWidget_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_34.Text
#: /Game/UI/WBP_VideoSubtitleWidget.WBP_VideoSubtitleWidget_C:WidgetTree.TextBlock_34.Text
msgctxt ",21D2099D4E5688F2AC906B922FCD77DA"
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "스킵"

